# Deterministic line endings: text sources are LF both in the index and on
# disk, on every platform. Fixes the recorded v4-baseline CRLF checkout drift
# (frozen cohort ledger hashes LF-normalized content; core.autocrlf=true
# materialized CRLF on disk, failing the hash-bound cohort tests). Markdown
# was added after the A9 frozen evaluator proved its architecture-authority
# check hashes the on-disk bytes (LF blob d5616edc... materialized as CRLF
# on disk, so the read-only authority hash always drifted).
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf
